## 9. Section 8 — Overlap Matrix

- For each pair of tickers, get their underlying breakdowns (normalised so each sums to 1), then `overlap(i, j) = Σ_h min(b_i_h, b_j_h)` over the intersection of holdings.
- Symmetric. Diagonal = 1. Off-diagonal in [0, 1].

