## 10. Section 9 — Excel Exporter (`create_builder_excel`)

Writes ~25 sheets grouped: **Inputs** (Configuration, Universe, Constraints, Benchmark Composition), **Weights** (Daily / Rebal / Turnover per portfolio), **Returns** (NAV, Daily, Cumulative, Monthly, Calendar), **Risk** (Key Summary, Rolling Vol, Drawdowns, Drawdown Top5, Correlation, Distribution Stats), **Vs Bench** (Benchmark NAV, Relative Metrics, Rolling Excess 12M *geometric*, Rolling TE 12M, Capture & Hit Ratios *geometric*), **Exposure** (Top Holdings, Sector/Country/Asset Class, Concentration HHI, Overlap, Fixed Income, Factor Exposures FF5), **Risk Analytics** (MCTR, MCTE, VaR CVaR, Brinson Sector/Country *time-averaged*, Efficient Frontier).

Sheet names are de-duplicated through a closure-based `_sheet(name)` helper that appends `_1`, `_2`, … on collisions.

