## 13. When you change a formula

1. Update the implementation.
2. Run `python -c "import ast; ast.parse(open('pages/Builder.py').read())"` — catches indentation drift `ReadLints` misses.
3. Run `pytest tests/` — fix any regressions intentionally; otherwise revert.
4. If a pinned test fails on purpose, regen the pinned numbers and **commit the formula change and the new pinned values together**.
5. Update the relevant section of this `.mdc` file so the next chat sees the new convention.
